# Repo-wide npm/pnpm settings. NEVER put a literal token in this file.
#
# Internal company registry (option A in docs/internal-component-library.md).
# Uncomment and replace the scope/URL. The token is read from an environment
# variable at install time, so this file stays safe to commit.
#
# @yourco:registry=https://pkgs.example.com/npm/registry/
# //pkgs.example.com/npm/registry/:_authToken=${COMPANY_NPM_TOKEN}
